{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1785764904194,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"session_id\":21,\"questions\":[{\"question_id\":85,\"question_order\":1,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you faced a significant technical challenge while working on a project. How did you approach understanding the problem, and what was the outcome?\"},{\"question_id\":86,\"question_order\":2,\"question\":\"Describe a situation where you had to collaborate with someone who had a different opinion or approach than your own. What steps did you take to ensure a productive resolution?\"},{\"question_id\":87,\"question_order\":3,\"question\":\"Share an example of when you identified an opportunity for improvement in a process or system – either within a team project or independently. How did you bring this to the attention of others, and what was the result?\"},{\"question_id\":88,\"question_order\":4,\"question\":\"Describe a time you made a mistake on a technical task. What happened, and most importantly, what did you learn from that experience?\"},{\"question_id\":89,\"question_order\":5,\"question\":\"Tell me about a situation where you had to adapt quickly to changing requirements or priorities during a project. How did you manage your workload and ensure successful delivery?\"}]}"]}
