{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786110371369,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"session_id\":25,\"questions\":[{\"question_id\":105,\"question_order\":1,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you faced a significant technical challenge while working on a project. What steps did you take to understand the problem and ultimately find a solution?\"},{\"question_id\":106,\"question_order\":2,\"question\":\"Describe a situation where you had to collaborate with someone who had a different approach or opinion than your own. How did you navigate that difference to achieve a positive outcome?\"},{\"question_id\":107,\"question_order\":3,\"question\":\"Share an example of when you made a mistake on a project – it doesn’t have to be a major failure! What did you learn from the experience, and how did you apply that learning moving forward?\"},{\"question_id\":108,\"question_order\":4,\"question\":\"Can you walk me through a time you had to adapt quickly to changing requirements or priorities during a software development cycle? What was your process for adjusting your work?\"},{\"question_id\":109,\"question_order\":5,\"question\":\"Describe a situation where you took initiative to improve a process or system. What motivated you, and what were the results of your actions?\"}]}"]}
