{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786110572609,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"session_id\":26,\"questions\":[{\"question_id\":110,\"question_order\":1,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you faced a significant technical challenge while working on a project. What steps did you take to understand the problem and ultimately find a solution?\"},{\"question_id\":111,\"question_order\":2,\"question\":\"Describe a situation where you had to collaborate with someone who had a different approach or opinion than your own. How did you navigate that difference to achieve a positive outcome?\"},{\"question_id\":112,\"question_order\":3,\"question\":\"Share an example of a time when you made a mistake on a project – it doesn’t have to be a major failure! What did you learn from the experience, and how did you apply those learnings moving forward?\"},{\"question_id\":113,\"question_order\":4,\"question\":\"Describe a situation where you had to adapt quickly to changing requirements or priorities during a software development cycle. What was your process for managing this shift, and what was the result?\"},{\"question_id\":114,\"question_order\":5,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you took initiative on a project or task beyond your defined responsibilities. What motivated you to do so, and what impact did it have?\"}]}"]}
