{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786110714903,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"answer_id\":41,\"total_score\":0,\"scores\":{\"situation\":0,\"task\":0,\"action\":0,\"result\":0},\"strengths\":[\"The candidate didn't provide an answer, which is a starting point. It indicates they were able to engage with the question and recognize it was being asked.\"],\"improvements\":[\"This response received a score of zero across all categories because no information was provided. To demonstrate adaptability, the candidate needs to describe a specific situation where changing requirements occurred.\",\"The interviewer will need to probe further to understand if the candidate has experience with this type of scenario.  Start by asking 'Can you tell me about a time when...?' and guiding them towards providing details.\"],\"feedback\":\"This response requires significant development. The candidate needs to demonstrate their ability to handle change, which is a critical skill in software development. Please provide a detailed example using the STAR method (Situation, Task, Action, Result) to illustrate your experience.”\",\"suggested_answer\":\"I need an answer from the candidate to evaluate.\"}"]}
