{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786113576820,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"session_id\":35,\"questions\":[{\"question_id\":155,\"question_order\":1,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you encountered a significant challenge while developing an ML model. What steps did you take to diagnose the problem and ultimately resolve it?\"},{\"question_id\":156,\"question_order\":2,\"question\":\"Describe a situation where you had to explain a complex technical concept related to machine learning to someone without a technical background. How did you tailor your communication, and what was the outcome?\"},{\"question_id\":157,\"question_order\":3,\"question\":\"Share an example of a time when you identified an opportunity to improve the performance or efficiency of an existing ML model or pipeline. What changes did you propose, and how were they implemented?\"},{\"question_id\":158,\"question_order\":4,\"question\":\"Describe a project where collaboration with other engineers (e.g., data scientists, software developers) was crucial for success. What role did you play in this collaboration, and what challenges did you overcome together?\"},{\"question_id\":159,\"question_order\":5,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you made a mistake or faced an unexpected outcome during the model development process. How did you handle the situation, what did you learn from it, and how would you approach a similar scenario differently now?\"}]}"]}
